  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math> are three logical statements, then the truth value of the statement <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8764;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is true, is",
