  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Clearly, if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></math> is true, <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></math> is true then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is true<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is true irrespective of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></math>",
